{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55579","headline":"索茗题巨觥（题拟） · 皮光业","name":"索茗题巨觥（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"未见甘心氏，先尝苦口师。\n（见《说郛》卷六一《清异录》。\n）（〖1〗《清异录》：「光业最耽茗事。\n一日，中表请尝新柑，簪绂丛集。\n才至未顾尊罍，而呼茶甚急。\n径进一巨觥，题诗曰〖诗略〗。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮光业","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55579.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55579","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}